one: the thread list shows only the 8 seeded threads, thread-1 is back to '23 replies' and thread-3 to '31 replies', the session is logged out, localStorage is empty, and signing in again with qa_tester1@example.com / pass1234 returns 'Invalid credentials. Try: tech@example.com'.\", \"evidence\": \"localStorage keys = []; post-reload thread list = seeded 8 only; login with registered credentials rejected.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty form submit -> stays on /new-thread with error 'Please fill in all fields'. Category=Technology with whitespace-only title and body -> same rejection, no thread created (no navigation to a thread detail).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password not verified at sign-in\", \"actual\": \"Signed in with email qa_tester1@example.com and deliberately wrong password 'wrongpass99' (registered password was 'pass1234'). App navigated to / and the header showed 'New Thread | qa_tester1', i.e. a logged-in session was created.\", \"evidence\": \"POST login with wrong password -> URL '/' and nav text 'ThreadHive New Thread qa_tester1'\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No sign-in path from discussion creation for unauthenticated users; /new-thread renders a blank page\", \"actual\": \"When logged out there is no 'New Thread' entry point anywhere in the UI (header shows only Login/Register, thread pages only disable the reply box). Reaching the discussion-creation route /new-thread directly renders a completely empty page (document body text is ''), with no redirect to sign-in, no message and no way to return to discussion creation after authenticating.\", \"evidence\": \"Logged-out /new-thread: semantic snapshot returned no elements; document.body.innerText = ''.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Trending list order 156,124,92,89,78,67,56,47